<title>GERMANY: Karpeles Schenker named TMA Germany agent.</title>
<headline>Karpeles Schenker named TMA Germany agent.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air cargo broker Karpeles Schenker &amp; Co Ltd said it has been named Germany and Luxemburg cargo general sales agent for Trans Mediterranean Airways (TMA), effective March 1.</p>
<p>TMA flies twice-weekly Boeing 707 freighter flights from Amsterdam and Paris to Beirut, with connections to Doha, Kuwait and Sharjah, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Cargo from Germany will be trucked to Amsterdam and Paris, it added.</p>
<p>Karpeles Schenker is a division of freight forwarder Schenker International AG.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
